{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2014/02/11/2553497/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、幕張にて個別握手会でした〜（ミ＾o＾ミ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それではお洋服の紹介＋＋"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回も、それぞれの部ごとに\n変えてみましたっ(o^^o)◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、まず一部っ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この時点では、ただの妖精。（笑）"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2014/02/11/2553497/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒いタイツには、片足だけリボンが付いています♪\n↑ココポイント！（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へーーんしんっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2014/02/11/2553497/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハッ！！！！！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2014/02/11/2553497/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しゅぱぱぱぱぱ！\nただの妖精から、『雪の妖精』へ\nレベルが上がったタァァ！！！！(二部)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなことしてるから、千葉県で、またもや大雪が降ってしまいました（笑）\nいや...むしろ、あの雪は、\n雪の妖精のチカラ！！！！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、さらに、\nゴセイジャーでいう、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"超天装っっっ！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バンッ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2014/02/11/2553497/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねこちゃんがプリントされたお洋服！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これがまさに、\n雪の妖精さゆにゃん！！！！！\nダァァ！！！！(三部)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして最後は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正義なる戦闘着で( ○・`ー・´)！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キリッと☆"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2014/02/11/2553497/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャツin！！！\n↑ここ重要！テストに出るぞーっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問にこたえるよ(ミ＾o＾ミ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎　にゃんさゆ普段はメガネなのー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊　普段はずっとメガネだよ〜！\nもう小学生の頃から、めがねっ娘です。\nパソコンのやり過ぎです笑（反省）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メガネだと視界が狭くて、楽譜が見づらいから、中学でコンタクトにしたんだけど、\n音楽(テナ夫)と出逢ってなかったら、ずーっとメガネだったと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の、相棒はマジレンジャーでした！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2014/02/11/2553497/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしが小学生くらいの戦隊ですかね！懐かしい〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、みなさん雪の中\n本当に有難う御座いました(。> <。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無事にお家には帰れたかな？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと沢山身体が冷えただろうから、今夜はあったかくして寝てくださいね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お約束だぞっ(o^^o)◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(。・ω・。)正義！"}],"source":"archive"}